Spike, the global animated series, is searching for talented voice actors to bring its characters to life! Our YouTube channel has reached over 1 billion views, entertaining children worldwide with universal, character-driven stories. We're casting our two lead roles: Spike, an imaginative, curious, and fearless 7-year-old whose creativity turns everyday moments into adventures; and Sparkle, his confident, attention-loving 5Â1⁄2-year-old sister with unmistakable main-character energy. Additionally, we are seeking versatile utility players who can perform multiple recurring characters - from the know-it-all giraffe girl, Poem, and the scared but loyal elephant boy, Muddles, to the bully rhino twins, Storm and Thunder, and the local mad scientist lion, Professor Roar, to name a few. Plus, there are loving parents, friends, foes, and all the colorful citizens that make Spike's world so vibrant.
What You Will Do:
Bring recurring characters to life with expressive performances that match the show's playful and energetic tone;
Help shape memorable voices and personalities for the faces of a global IP;
Deliver engaging voice performances that support clear storytelling in fast-paced 3â5 minute episodes;
Perform dialogue that enhances visual comedy and elevates emotional moments;
Maintain consistent character voices and performances across multiple episodes;
Take direction well, adjusting pacing, emotion, and delivery as needed;
Record clean, broadcast-quality audio from a professional home studio;
